  "dcterms:description": "The openly-licensed DrugBank Open Data drug vocabulary: DrugBank accession, common name, CAS, UNII, and synonyms for approved/experimental drugs. This brick uses ONLY the CC0-licensed open subset (drug vocabulary), NOT the license-restricted full DrugBank XML.",
