  "biobricks:reviewed": false,
  "biobricks:reviewNotes": "source.jsonld back-filled 2026-07-15 (was missing). Open-data vocabulary subset = CC0. Version pinned at 5.1.12: as of 2026-07-15 DrugBank has DISABLED academic/open downloads site-wide (both 5.1.12 and 5.1.13 URLs return 'Academic downloads are currently disabled'), so a version bump is not currently possible. Revisit if downloads are re-enabled.",
